356	                    // ExpressionClause which is a fancy builder to define expressions and predicates
357	                    // using fluent builders in the DSL. However, we need afterwards a callback to
358	                    // reset the expression to the expression type the ExpressionClause did build for us
359	                    ExpressionFactory model = clause.getExpressionType();
